          Engineered for Permanence.
        </span>
      </h1>

      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-normal leading-relaxed">
        We craft turnkey software platforms that streamline critical operations for educational institutions, community centers, and digital organizations. Every platform is delivered with complete source ownership and isolated private data.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 sm:gap-4 pt-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        
        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/90 shadow-xs text-center">
          <div class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-[#192040]">100%</div>
          <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mt-0.5">Source & IP Ownership</div>
          <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5">Zero SaaS vendor lock-in</div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/90 shadow-xs text-center">
          <div class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-emerald-600">$0</div>
          <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mt-0.5">Per-Seat User Fees</div>
